          "y": 774,
          "width": 306,
          "height": 63,
          "content": "Scene / Prefab formats · displayList / plainObjects · Phaser GameObjects · component properties · Asset Pack key/type · Phaser JSONAnimations · Arcade Physics / Box2D authoring · User Components",
