          "name": "Boundary description 1",
          "x": 390,
          "y": 774,
          "width": 306,
          "height": 63,
          "content": "SolidJS Workbench · docking / splitters / workspace persistence · command palette · rebuilt Inspector · redesigned Asset Browser · integrated Scene / Game host · new Timeline surface",
